    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm botherin writing this tbh. it feels like i'm just talking to a wall. everything i used to be... it's just gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person there. it's like the real me died a long time ago and now i'm just this shell walking around, just going through the motions. it's exhausting. just being here, existing, when there's nothing left to actually *be*.",
